.TH SDL_GetRendererName 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetRendererName \- Get the name of a renderer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetRendererName(SDL_Renderer *renderer);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I renderer
the rendering context\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the name of the selected renderer, or NULL on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

